            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Human Costs of Border Control project, Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam:  Tamara Last is doing PhD research on the relationship between border policies and migrant mortality.  Dr Theodore Baird is doing post-doctoral research on privatisation of border control.  Dr Paolo Cuttitta is doing post-doctoral research on humanitarianism in border control.  Prof Dr Thomas Spijkerboer is doing research on state responsibility concerning migrant mortality."
            ]
